OL,3,GNEWSA'The whole street was on fire':
OL,4,AInside the West Midlands wildfire
OL,5,Adisaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is 13:00 BST on the hottest day of
OL,8,Fthe year and five engines are speeding
OL,9,Ftowards a grass fire in Birmingham.
OL,11,FTemperatures are creeping towards 38C
OL,12,Fand it has been yet another busy
OL,13,Fmorning at West Midlands Fire Control.
OL,15,FBut within minutes, the switchboard is
OL,16,Fjammed with panicked calls about
OL,17,Fwildfires in fields and parks that are
OL,18,Fmoving dangerously close to homes.
OL,20,F"We had 20-plus 999 calls in a queue,"
OL,21,Frecalls control room firefighter Lauren
OL,22,FNightingale.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
